#: lib/InventoryPage.php
msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Čekanje na prenos broji taktove u kojima je port imao podatke za slanje, ali ih nije mogao poslati zbog nedostatka kredita ili arbitraže. Visoka vrijednost pokazuje zagušenje prema udaljenoj strani i ne znači da su port ili kabl neispravni. Trajanje takta nije objavljeno za aktuelne brzine linka, pa su vrijednosti izražene u taktovima po sekundi, a ne u vremenu."

